OL,3,GNEWSATraffic enforcement measures to
OL,4,Acome into place
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first of 10 new traffic enforcement
OL,7,Fcameras being introduced in Northampton
OL,8,Fwill go live on Sunday.
OL,10,FWest Northamptonshire Council said it
OL,11,Fwould be monitoring a banned right turn
OL,12,Fon Upton Valley Way East, at its
OL,13,Fjunction with Banbury Lane.
OL,15,FThe authority said it would soon be
OL,16,Ffollowed by a yellow box junction
OL,17,Fcamera on Weedon Road, at the junction
OL,18,Fwith Spencer Bridge Road, following
OL,19,Fcompletion of further testing.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
