OL,3,GNEWSATraffic enforcement measures to
OL,4,Acome into place
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is not about catching people out.
OL,7,FIt's about encouraging people to follow
OL,8,Fthe rules," said Richard Butler,
OL,9,Fcabinet member for highways and
OL,10,Ftransport at the Reform UK-led
OL,11,Fauthority.
